\newlabel{fig:grad_contrib}{{14}{9}{Per-layer gradient contribution magnitudes for Canon and Llama mid-training. The Llama baseline shows a steep decline from deep to shallow layers; Canon produces a much flatter profile}{figure.caption.19}{}}
